# The shell of ext_shell_faces, open at the top, then at a side instead
# by [take the selection] with the side picked; the same as
# path_shell_faces.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/shell_faces, ROADMAP
# F7).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 80
click-face top face of g003-extrude
menu Features|Shell Solid
answer ok
twmove 195 145
twdown L 195 145
twup L 195 145
view iso
click-face side face of g003-extrude from r006-line-segment
twmove 195 145
twdown L 195 145
twup L 195 145
twmove 312 75
twdown L 312 75
twup L 312 75
